# LIFEOS/ — mirrors the PAI/ rules above (added 2026-08-21)
#
# The 2026-08-20 migration moved PAI/ -> LIFEOS/ but .gitignore was never
# updated, leaving 34 dead PAI/ rules and the live LIFEOS/ tree unprotected.
# Both trees currently exist and both are written to.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
LIFEOS/USER/CREDENTIALS/
LIFEOS/.env
LIFEOS/PULSE/certs/
LIFEOS/MEMORY/LEARNING/
LIFEOS/MEMORY/OBSERVABILITY/
LIFEOS/MEMORY/SECURITY/
LIFEOS/MEMORY/STATE/
LIFEOS/MEMORY/VOICE/
LIFEOS/MEMORY/ARCHIVE/
LIFEOS/MEMORY/KNOWLEDGE/_embeddings/
LIFEOS/MEMORY/KNOWLEDGE/_harvest-queue/
LIFEOS/USER/ARBOL/
LIFEOS/USER/CREDENTIALS/
LIFEOS/USER/browser-state/
LIFEOS/USER/FINANCES/
LIFEOS/USER/HEALTH/
LIFEOS/USER/Plans/
LIFEOS/debug/
LIFEOS/Monitor/
LIFEOS/Components/
LIFEOS/tmp/
LIFEOS/research/
LIFEOS/screenshots/
LIFEOS/services/
LIFEOS/output/
LIFEOS/data/
LIFEOS/repos/
LIFEOS/helios/
LIFEOS/Releases/
LIFEOS/ide/
LIFEOS/IDE/
LIFEOS/voice-server
LIFEOS/PAIWorker/
LIFEOS/PAI_RELEASES/

# Secrets — belt and braces, any depth
**/.env
**/.credentials.json
**/CREDENTIALS/
*.pem
*.key

# Third-party personal data — Dom's call 2026-08-21.
# CONTACTS holds other people's information, not just Dom's; OPINIONS is
# candid and not intended for any history, private remote or not.
LIFEOS/USER/CONTACTS.md
LIFEOS/USER/OPINIONS.md
**/CONTACTS.md
**/OPINIONS.md

# Runtime churn — rewritten every ~2min by the Pulse process, plus this
# session's own transcript log. Tracking these means a permanently dirty
# working tree and meaningless diffs. Added 2026-08-21.
LIFEOS/PULSE/state/
LIFEOS/PULSE/Performance/aggregator-state.json
history.jsonl

# TLS certs issued by `tailscale cert` for the Pulse HTTPS listener.
# The private key is already caught by *.key; the .crt is public but the whole
# directory is machine-specific and renewable, so none of it belongs in git.
LIFEOS/USER/CONFIG/certs/
